\\ UNIT 01: ARITHMETIC OPERATORS

2 + 3       \\ Addition
5 - 3       \\ Subtraction
5 * 3       \\ Multiplication
5 / 3       \\ Exact division
5 \ 3       \\ Integer quotient
5 % 3       \\ Remainder (modulo)
2^10        \\ Exponentiation
5!          \\ Factorial

i = 4;      \\ Assign value to i
i++         \\ Increment i
i--         \\ Decrement i
i += 3      \\ Add 3 to i
i -= 2      \\ Subtract 2 from i
i *= 2      \\ Multiply i by 2
i /= 2      \\ Divide i by 2
